{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ribbit Ranch is a cozy idle game where you unwind while you collect and care for frogs. Raise these frogs and sell for them for a profit or keep them around to use in mini-games, breeding and to passively generate money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open packs to get rare frog combinations! Be on the lookout for ultra-rare golden frogs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928690/extras/d5c780f25c225459268eb4442ef98b94.poster.avif?t=1754546638\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928690/extras/d5c780f25c225459268eb4442ef98b94.webm?t=1754546638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your frogs by feeding them, and decide to keep them or sell them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928690/extras/44040aae58b10c39630e8d2b15956ae4.poster.avif?t=1754546638\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928690/extras/44040aae58b10c39630e8d2b15956ae4.webm?t=1754546638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play mini-games to  get special frogs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928690/extras/129c825a93bc6aaaf41195b533e9baaa.poster.avif?t=1754546638\" width=600 h